{"id":"vod_hh_116141","vodId":"116141","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"深渊传说","name_cn":"深渊传说","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第26集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/95d7629833b2a4f52ad07bab706d38a8.jpg"},"summary":"距离现在2000年前，第七音素(セブンスフォニム)的发现，行星的诞生至到被消灭的未来都记载在“星之记忆”中。因此各国都为了得到星之记忆，使奥尔多兰特开始战乱的时代。\n　　长期的战争使大地疲乏，产生了有毒的障气。人们就随着懂得读取星之记忆的谱术士尤利亚·乔艾的预言，把充满障气大地封住。\n　　时至今日——\n　　世界被分为奇姆拉斯卡·蓝巴尔迪亚王国和马尔库特帝国二大国家，保持着短暂的和平。但是真正支配人们的，不是两国的王国，而是守护着尤利亚教训的罗雷莱宗教团的“预言”。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-12-22 12:06:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en55Q8Dd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwpp92me/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en55QmYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwpp9yge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b688opRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkkZr4a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYYQlra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0RRqJ7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPPlZzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b8222XLe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ666R2e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b6888jLe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkkkx2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQWWWpGd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM88845e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejRRRGWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYYYO1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus